  "note": ""
 },
 {
  "id": "briefing_800AA7B6",
  "en": "$f21a%2Dr. Saotome%0: There's no telling what might happen, or when. Save often, so you'll have nothing to regret!",
  "note": ""
 },
 {
  "id": "briefing_800AA816",
  "en": "$f63a%2Hayato%0$p01: Guess it can't be helped. I'll lend you a hand.",
  "note": ""
 },
 {
  "id": "briefing_800AA842",
  "en": "$f02a%2Musashi%0$p02: With the great Musashi on board, it's like having a hundred men!",
  "note": ""
 },
 {
  "id": "briefing_800AA876",
  "en": "$f03a%2Benkei%0$p03: I'm Benkei. It's an honor to fight alongside Musashi.",
  "note": ""
 },
 {
  "id": "briefing_800AA8B4",
  "en": "$f04a%2Go%0$p04: The name's Go! I'm counting on you guys!",
  "note": ""
 },
 {
  "id": "briefing_800AA8DE",
  "en": "$f05a%2Sho%0$p05: I'm Sho Tachibana. Nice to meet you.",
  "note": ""
 },
 {
  "id": "briefing_800AA906",
  "en": "$f06a%2Gai%0$p06: Leave the robot repairs to me.",
  "note": ""
 },
 {
  "id": "briefing_800AA934",
  "en": "$f08a%2Lambert%0$p08: I may be an old fossil, but I'll prove I can still be of use.",
  "note": ""
 },
 {
  "id": "briefing_800AA972",
  "en": "$f09a%2Schwartz%0$p09: Very well, I suppose I'll lend you my strength.",
  "note": ""
 },
 {
  "id": "briefing_800AA9AE",
  "en": "$f10a%2Bob%0$p0a: I'll fight with everything I've got. I'm counting on you.",
  "note": ""
 },
 {
  "id": "briefing_800AA9E0",
  "en": "$f11a%2Sam%0$p0b: Defense is my strong suit. Leave it to me.",
  "note": ""
 },
 {
  "id": "briefing_800AAA18",
  "en": "$f12a%2Linda%0$p0c: Hello, everyone. I look forward to working with you.",
  "note": ""
 },
 {
  "id": "briefing_800AAA4A",
  "en": "$f13a%2Shatner%0$p0d: I'm Heim Shatner. Just call me Shatner.",
  "note": ""
 },
 {
  "id": "briefing_800AAA92",
  "en": "$f14a%2Jack%0$p0e: Hey, everybodyyy! Let's have a fun time, OK-desu!",
  "note": ""
 },
 {
  "id": "briefing_800AAACE",
  "en": "$f15a%2Mary%0$p0f: Hiii! My brother and I are joining you! Nice to meet you!",
  "note": ""
 },
 {
  "id": "briefing_800AAB1A",
  "en": "$f16a%2Akane%0$p10: Let's join forces and give it our all!",
  "note": ""
 },
 {
  "id": "briefing_800AAB48",
  "en": "$f17a%2Tsubaki%0$p11: I'm Tsubaki... I'll be counting on you.",
  "note": ""
 },
 {
  "id": "briefing_800AAB72",
  "en": "$f18a%2Kaede%0$p12: Ummm... uh... I'll do my beeest.",
  "note": ""
 },
